WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.936 --> 00:00:06.001
Continue an existing analysis
Run oncotracer --interactive --backend conda. Choose New analysis or Continue an existing analysis. This is a synthetic demo.

2
00:00:06.001 --> 00:00:14.766
Continue an existing analysis · open the saved project
Stop the project's current run. Choose Continue an existing analysis, then select its output project containing config/run.yml and results.

3
00:00:14.766 --> 00:00:17.525
Continue an existing analysis · validate completed work
Load saved settings and check. Saved samples and settings stay together. Incomplete alignments are not accepted as completed work.

4
00:00:17.525 --> 00:00:22.404
Continue an existing analysis · choose concurrent samples
In Review and run, choose parallel sample jobs × cores per sample. Run applies and checks the choice; Apply resources and check previews it without starting. Completed work is verified before reuse.

5
00:00:22.404 --> 00:00:34.973
Continue an existing analysis · optional manual count
Choose Manual to enter your own number of parallel samples. Suggestions remain available; too many jobs can exhaust memory. Automatic adapts to the machine.

6
00:00:34.973 --> 00:00:40.855
Continue an existing analysis · resume when ready
Review the checks, then choose Run analysis to continue. This recording stops here; its checks are simulated and no analysis runs.
